    {
      "id": "CVE-2026-74676",
      "publishedDate": "2026-08-22T15:32:45.256Z",
      "lastModifiedDate": "2026-08-25T05:23:18.083Z",
      "description": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nvt: add permission check for KDSKBMETA ioctl\n\nKDSKBMETA modifies keyboard meta mode but lacks the !perm check that all\nother keyboard setter ioctls in vt_k_ioctl() enforce, allowing a process\nto change meta mode on a non-controlling console without authorization.",
      "severity": "N/A",
      "fix_suggestion": "📦 受影响组件：Linux Linux\n🛠️ 修复建议：\n1. 确认受影响的版本范围（见上方 Affected Products）\n2. 升级到厂商官方发布的最稳定安全版本\n3. 检查官方安全公告获取补丁链接\n4. 如无法立即升级，实施临时缓解措施：\n   - 网络层：WAF 规则 / IPS 签名 / 零信任策略\n   - 主机层：最小化暴露面 / 禁用危险功能 / 输入过滤\n5. 修复后使用 NVD / 厂商 PoC 验证修复有效性",
